{
  "version": "3.0.4",
  "published_at": "2026-10-31T20:00:00+08:00",
  "download_url": "https://github.com/yakrsa/MiteProxy/releases/latest",
  "changes": [
    {
      "zh": "修复长时间后台抓包后进程无声退出。根因是构建所用 Python 3.14.0 的增量式垃圾回收缺陷：循环引用不再被定时回收，内存只涨不降（实测运行 5 小时 49 分涨到 1878MB），回收器遍历到已损坏的对象时触发访问违规，进程直接消失，且不留任何 Python 栈。现已把构建解释器升级到 Python 3.14.10（该缺陷在 3.14.5 已由官方回滚），并新增内存守护：按内存增长触发回收，日志中可见「内存回收：1180.3MB → 402.1MB（释放 …，回收 N 个循环，耗时 …）」；设置项 auto_gc 可关闭",
      "en": "Fixed the silent process exit after hours of background capture. The root cause was the incremental garbage collector in the Python 3.14.0 build: cyclic garbage stopped being collected on schedule and memory only grew (1,878 MB after 5h49m in testing). The collector then walked a corrupted object, hit an access violation and took the process down with no Python traceback at all. The build interpreter is now Python 3.14.10 (the defect was rolled back upstream in 3.14.5), plus a new memory guard that collects on growth and logs entries such as 'memory reclaimed: 1180.3MB -> 402.1MB'. It can be turned off with the auto_gc setting"
    },
    {
      "zh": "域名过滤支持通配符：*.apple.com、*.apple.*、api.*.com、*foo.com 均可直接填写。此前 * 被当作普通字符，填了只会一条都匹配不到；命中数统计同步支持通配符，不再出现「列表已隐藏但命中数显示 0」的不一致",
      "en": "Wildcards in domain filters: *.apple.com, *.apple.*, api.*.com and *foo.com now work as expected. Previously * was treated as a literal character and matched nothing at all. The hit counter understands wildcards too, so the 'hidden but zero count' inconsistency is gone"
    },
    {
      "zh": "修复详情面板右侧 header 的拖拽范围过窄，以及请求/响应分隔条在切换页签时位置跳变",
      "en": "Fixed the narrow drag area on the detail panel headers and the request/response splitter jumping to a different position when switching tabs"
    }
  ]
}
